BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:🎬 CohortNYC Film Lab public screening + talkback
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260907T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260907T213000
DTSTAMP:20260902T173410Z
UID:hipointe-performance-613352@hipointe-calendar
SEQUENCE:0
DESCRIPTION:Runtime: 120 minutes\nFormat: Digital Projection September 7th
  is the culminating screening for Cohort’s latest St. Louis Film Lab. Lo
 cal filmmakers formed teams and had two weeks to create original short fil
 ms from a shared creative prompt. The screening brings everyone back toget
 her to premiere the films and celebrate the work. Cohort is a multi-city c
 reative network and production company built around connecting emerging fi
 lmmakers with collaborators\, resources\, and real production opportunitie
 s. Through our Film Labs\, creators meet\, form teams\, make work together
 \, and can continue into Cohort’s larger production network. Website: ht
 tps://cohortnyc.com Cinema St. Louis Policies Parking & Directions Accessi
 bility Contact Copyright © 2026\n\nhttps://hipointetheatre.org/movies/coh
 ortnyc-film-lab-screening/
LOCATION:Hi-Pointe Theatre\n1005 McCausland Ave\nSt. Louis\, MO 63117
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://hipointetheatre.org/movies/cohortnyc-film-lab-screening/
END:VEVENT
